<div class="acc__body" id="a5" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p>To report a lost or stolen credit card, please call immediately 1-877-929-FACE (1-877-929-3223) or 787-705-7642. <strong>To access the benefits of the automated answering system, you will need specific information that you can find within <a href="https://secure.facebank.pr/">Online Banking</a>under “Credit Card,” “INFO. REPORT LOST / STOLEN CREDIT CARD”</strong></p>
<p>In case of emergency and to access your MasterAssist services (available only to Mastercard Platinum cardholders), you must contact the Mastercard International assistance center within the United States at 1-800-MASTERCARD (1-800-627-8372).</p>
<p>Outside the United States, call 1-636-722-7111, or in the country where you are located, select <a href="/en/portfolio-items/cuentas-bancarias/">here</a> for a list of phone numbers by country. For a description of the available emergency services, visit our webpage at <a href="/en/PlatinumMasterCardBenefits.pdf/">Credit Card Benefits</a>.</p>
