<div class="acc__body" id="a7" hidden><div class="acc__content">
<p><span lang="ES-PR">To deposit your checks, money orders, or travelers checks, contact your Business Facilitator, who is able to accept them and send them to our nearest operational support center in your area.</span></p>
<p><span lang="ES-PR">Your checks will be digitized and deposited into your account on the same day they are received.</span></p>
<p>If you prefer to send them to our main office, please send them in a sealed envelope to the following address:</p>
<div>FACEBANK INTERNATIONAL</div>
<div><span lang="ES-PR">17 Calle 2 STE 600</span></div>
<div><span lang="ES-PR">Guaynabo, Puerto Rico 00968-1787</span></div>
<p><span lang="ES-PR">Remember to write the FACEBANK account number and the client’s full name.</span></p>
<div><strong><span lang="ES-PR">FOR DEPOSIT ONLY</span></strong></div>
